  "Description": "Processes a dialogue turn. One SubAIM, Entity Dialogue Processing. The UA writes the user's Text (and optionally the Text Descriptors, Personal Status, User ID, Object IDs, Scene, and running Summary) to boundary ports; the Controller routes them to EDP; the Machine's response Text, Personal Status, and updated Summary come back. The two OSD-IID inputs (User ID, Object IDs) are told apart by PortNumber on the AIM Input side, mirroring UAG-IDR.",
